## 2. Typed settings client — public API & wiring

### Public API (`DeviceSettingsClient`)

```7:53:packages/core/core_device_native_runtime/lib/src/settings/service/device_settings_client.dart
abstract interface class DeviceSettingsClient {
  /// 设置设备输出音量。
  Future<Result<void>> setVolume(DeviceSettingsTarget target, int volume);

  /// 设置音频或视频的最大录制时长。
  Future<Result<void>> setRecordDuration(
    DeviceSettingsTarget target,
    DeviceRecordKind kind,
    int seconds,
  );

  /// 设置视频画面方向。
  Future<Result<void>> setVideoOrientation(
    DeviceSettingsTarget target,
    DeviceVideoOrientation orientation,
  );

  /// 设置语音唤醒开关。
  Future<Result<void>> setVoiceWakeup(
    DeviceSettingsTarget target,
    bool enabled,
  );

  /// 设置新手引导模式。
  Future<Result<void>> setGuideMode(DeviceSettingsTarget target, bool enabled);

  /// 设置佩戴检测开关。
  Future<Result<void>> setWearDetection(
    DeviceSettingsTarget target,
    bool enabled,
  );

  /// 获取佩戴检测开关状态。
  Future<Result<bool>> getWearDetection(DeviceSettingsTarget target);

  /// 设置霍尔开关。
  Future<Result<void>> setHallSwitch(DeviceSettingsTarget target, bool enabled);

  /// 设置自动关机分钟数。
  Future<Result<void>> setAutoShutdownMinutes(
    DeviceSettingsTarget target,
    int minutes,
  );

  /// 获取自动关机分钟数。
  Future<Result<int>> getAutoShutdownMinutes(DeviceSettingsTarget target);
}
```

