## 6. Features already using `DeviceSettingsClient`

### `feature_device_settings` — volume only

```13:57:packages/feature/device/feature_device_settings/lib/src/controller/device_settings_controller.dart
/// 通过原生 runtime 的 typed settings client 应用设备设置。
class DeviceSettingsController extends Notifier<DeviceSettingsState> {
  DeviceSettingsClient get _settingsClient =>
      ref.read(deviceSettingsClientProvider);
  // ...
  /// 设置设备音量。
  Future<Result<void>> setVolume(int volume) async {
    final session = ref.read(bleSessionProvider);
    final deviceId = session.deviceId;
    if (!session.isConnected || deviceId == null || deviceId.isEmpty) {
      return const Result.failure(
        AppError(
          code: 'device_transport.session_not_active',
          message: 'No active device connection',
        ),
      );
    }
    final sendResult = await _settingsClient.setVolume(
      DeviceSettingsTarget(deviceId: deviceId),
      volume,
    );
    // ...
  }
}
```

**Note:** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/device/feature_device_settings/lib/src/pages/device_settings_page.dart` L62–111 — wear detection, voice wakeup, auto power-off, beginner guide all use `onTap: showSoon` (UI placeholders, **not wired** to client).

