## 7. Plan 0035 — settings migration guidance & status

Relevant excerpts from `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/docs/plans/0035-native-device-capability-migration.md`:

**Goal (L8–15):** Converge proven native SDK capabilities into `core_device_native_runtime` typed clients; upper layers must not depend on Flutter raw frames / `GlassesOrder`.

**First slice (L23–24):** `DeviceSettingsClient` — volume, record duration, orientation, voice wakeup, guide mode, wear detection, hall switch, auto shutdown.

**Acceptance — completed (L42–47):**
- `[x] DeviceSettingsClient` provides API, validation, errors, Provider; both Apps inject same runtime; settings Feature no longer depends on raw sender
- `[x] Android/iOS adapters run in generation-bound lease; missing AKW/BK capabilities return `settings.capability_unsupported`

**Progress — completed (L61–64):**
- `[x] 实现并迁移 DeviceSettingsClient：settings Feature 与相册多媒体设置不再调用已删除的 settings raw sender/builder`
- `[x] iOS settings 改用 operation-scoped raw forwarder` (native-side detail)

**Current instruction boundary (L133–143):**

> 已由 SDK typed client 下发：**设备设置**、家庭 Wi-Fi、预览/音乐网络建链、设备媒体导入、绑定身份回写

**Decision (L151–152):** One production implementation per capability; migration PR must delete old raw call sites in the same batch — no dual paths.

**Related completed plan:** `/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/docs/plans/0021-album-multimedia-settings.md` originally specified raw `0x34/0x01` and `0x34/0x09`; superseded by `9634a25f` migration to `DeviceSettingsClient`.

